        "name": "Luck",
        "description": "You can spend 1 Luck to do the following:</br><b>Advantage:</b> Grant Favor on a d20 roll.</br><b>Fluke:</b> Reroll an unresolved die you rolled.<br><b>Plot Armor (variant):</b> Once per Round, if you are reduced to 0 HP, you can spend 1 Luck to regain d6 HP."
      },
      "studied": {
        "name": "Studied Die",
        "description": "You can spend a Studied die to gain Favor on a d20 roll you make in the next day. You must do so before the d20 roll resolves. You lose any unspent Studied dice after a day."
      }
